install python and VS code

Windows: Go to the official Python website (python.org) and download the latest installer. During installation, check "Add Python to PATH" to run Python from the command prompt easily, then click "Install Now"


Also install VS code and then install extension python

------------------------------------------------------------------------

How python code executes
- python code runs line by line (interpreter-based)
- no need to compile manually- interpreter handles it
- each line is converted into bytecode, then executed by the python virtual machine (PVM)
- errors stops execution immediately.